            "description": "Used order in request.\n\n<p>Usage examples:</p>\n<pre><em>order: {\"principal\": \"ASC\"}      => ORDER BY entity.principal ASC<br />order: {\"criadoEm\": \"DESC\"}      => ORDER BY entity.criadoEm DESC </em></pre>\n\n<p>Advanced usage  examples:</p>\n<pre><em>order: {\"principal\": \"DESC\", \"criadoEm\": \"DESC\"}   => ORDER BY entity.principal ASC, entity.criadoEm DESC </em></pre>\n",
